<title>USA: Medical Manager names John Sessions COO.</title>
<headline>Medical Manager names John Sessions COO.</headline>
<dateline>TAMPA, Fla. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medical Manager Corp said it appointed John Sessions as Chief Operating Officer effective May 1.</p>
<p>For the past eleven years, Sessions has been executive vice president and chief operating officer of Companion Technologies, a wholly owned subsidiary of Blue Cross and Blue Shield of South Carolina.</p>
